    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Infused by the void itself, the Ren'dorei - children of the void - are a group of blood elves exiled from their homeland of Quel'Thalas. Cast out for their teachings at the hand of the elven magister Umbric, the elves have embraced their newfound powers, though the inner turmoil it has caused may well follow them through their lives as they fight to maintain control over it.</p>",
